---
title: "withdrawRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: projectAdmin calls withdrawRaisedCapital()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: hasEnded == true
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period still active
    q_check_refund --> q_check_published: refund period completed
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_published --> q_revert_not_published: raisedCapital not published
    q_check_published --> q_calc_fees: raisedCapital published
    q_revert_not_published --> [*]: revert RaisedCapitalNotPublished
    q_calc_fees --> q_transfer_legion: legionCapitalFee = raisedCapital * legionFeeOnCapitalRaisedBps / 10000
    q_transfer_legion --> q_transfer_referrer: transfer legionCapitalFee bidToken to legionFeeRecipient
    q_transfer_referrer --> q_calc_project: referrerCapitalFee = raisedCapital * referrerFeeOnCapitalRaisedBps / 10000, transfer to referrer
    q_calc_project --> q_transfer_project: projectAmount = raisedCapital - legionCapitalFee - referrerCapitalFee
    q_transfer_project --> q_emit: transfer projectAmount bidToken to projectAdmin
    q_emit --> [*]: emit RaisedCapitalWithdrawn(projectAmount, legionCapitalFee, referrerCapitalFee)

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: Capital withdrawal requires sale ended + refund period completed + raisedCapital published
        INV-002: Fee distribution: legion fee + referrer fee + project amount = raisedCapital
        INV-003: Once capital is withdrawn, vesting term modifications are prohibited
        INV-004: Early capital withdrawal is allowed before token supply for operational needs
    end note
